direction: right
Data: Curated data {shape: stored_data}
Features: Feature store {shape: cylinder}
Training: Training pipeline {shape: rectangle}
Tracking: Experiment tracking {shape: rectangle}
Registry: Model registry {shape: stored_data}
Deploy: Deployment pipeline {shape: rectangle}
Serving: Model serving {shape: rectangle}
Monitor: Drift monitor {shape: rectangle}
Alerts: Alert channel {shape: queue}
Data -> Features
Features -> Training
Training -> Tracking
Training -> Registry
Registry -> Deploy: approved model
Deploy -> Serving
Features -> Serving: online features
Serving -> Monitor: predictions
Monitor -> Alerts
Monitor -> Training: retrain trigger
